  "summary": "三列看板泳道（待办/进行中/已完成），卡片可用 pointer 拖到另一列，拖动时半透明跟随、目标列高亮，松手落下并更新列头计数。",
  "usage": "任务看板、项目迭代、招聘 / 审批流程这类按状态分列的卡片流。",
  "caution": "列超过 5 个时改成横向滚动，别硬挤三列；卡片内内容很多时不要整卡拖动（拖拽把手更稳）。",
  "hint": "按住卡片拖到另一列，松手落下；目标列会高亮",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【看板泳道 Kanban】目标：三列泳道（待办 / 进行中 / 已完成），每列 2–3 张卡片；卡片可以用 pointer 拖到另一列，拖动时卡片半透明跟随指针、目标列高亮，松手落下并更新列头计数。\n\n1) 结构：.board（`position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; gap:6px; padding:10px 12px`）；每列 .col 是 `flex:1; min-width:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column`，包含 .col-head（标题 + 计数徽标）和 .cards（flex 列，卡片容器）；卡片 .card 是 relative 的块（padding 6px 7px、圆角 7px、白底、细边框、轻投影、`cursor:grab`）。\n2) 拖拽（pointer 事件，不用 HTML5 drag）：卡片上 `pointerdown` → preventDefault + 记录起点 + 加 `.dragging`（`opacity:.72; z-index:20; cursor:grabbing`，阴影加深、边框主色）+ `card.style.transition='none'`（跟手）+ `setPointerCapture`（try/catch）；`pointermove` → `transform: translate(dx,dy) rotate(1.5deg) scale(1.03)` 跟随，并按指针坐标判断落在哪一列（遍历列 rect，命中且不是原列则加 `.drop-target`）；`pointerup` → 释放捕获，若目标列存在且不是原列则 `target.querySelector('.cards').appendChild(card)`，清 transform / dragging / drop-target，更新计数。\n3) 目标列高亮：`.col.drop-target` 背景 `color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 7%,var(--ui-bg))`、边框主色 45% 透明，过渡 0.18 秒。\n4) 计数：列头 .cnt 显示该列卡片数，拖放后重新统计每列 `.card` 数量。\n5) 演示（卡片预览自动播）：光标移到第一列第一张卡 → 按下 → 卡片以 0.55 秒缓动滑到第二列上方并高亮第二列 → 松手落下（卡片进第二列、计数 2→3、第一列 2→1）→ 收起光标 → 3.6 秒后复位重来。\n6) **弹窗初始态必须干净（关键）**：弹窗打开时**所有卡片都归位**（`transform: ''`，计算值应为 none 或 matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)），**绝不能把演示拖动残留的 `rotate(1.5deg)/translate` 留在初始帧**——否则用户一打开弹窗就看到一张歪掉的卡片叠在别的卡上。初始态只做 `remove('dragging')` + 清 transform/transition + 清 drop-target + 更新计数，不要模拟拖动悬停。\n7) 无障碍：卡片加 tabindex=\"0\"；真实项目里拖拽还应支持键盘（Tab 聚焦 + 方向键移动列），demo 只保留 pointer。\n8) 坑：①**卡片容器千万不要 `overflow:hidden`**——拖动时卡片用 transform 移出容器会被裁掉，看起来像卡片凭空消失（这个坑踩过）；②拖动时 `transition` 必须设为 none 才跟手，演示动画才恢复 transition；③`setPointerCapture` 要做 try/catch（合成 PointerEvent 会抛 InvalidPointerId）；④指针移出所有列时所有 `.drop-target` 都要清掉；⑤松手目标是原列时不做移动，只清状态；⑥卡片 transform 用完必须清回 `''`，否则复位后卡片还歪着；⑦**演示循环结束（resetBoard）和弹窗初始化都要把所有卡片的 transform 清空**——这是「弹窗一打开有张卡是歪的」的根因；⑧拖拽期间禁用 `user-select` 和 `touch-action`，否则移动端会触发滚动/选中。\n9) 配色：列底文字色 3% 混画布、列边框文字色 8%、目标列主色 7% + 边框 45%、卡片 --ui-surface、计数徽标文字色 7% 底、拖动卡片阴影加深。\n10) 使用场景：任务看板、项目迭代、招聘/审批流程这类按状态分列的卡片流；列超过 5 个时改成横向滚动，不要硬挤。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg)}\n\n.board{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;gap:6px;padding:10px 12px;overflow:hidden}\n.col{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;padding:6px;border-radius:10px;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 3%,var(--ui-bg));\n  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent);\n  transition:background-color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}\n.col.drop-target{\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 7%,var(--ui-bg));\n  border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,transparent)}\n.col-head{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:0 2px}\n.col-head b{font-size:8px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.cnt{margin-left:auto;flex:0 0 auto;font-size:7px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 7%,transparent);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:999px}\n.cards{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}\n\n.card{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;padding:6px 7px;border-radius:7px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);\n  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent);\n  box-shadow:0 1px 2px color-mix(in srgb,#000 5%,transparent);\n  cursor:grab;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;touch-action:none;\n  transition:transform .2s ease,opacity .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease}\n.card b{font-size:8px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.card span{font-size:7px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.card.dragging{opacity:.72;cursor:grabbing;z-index:20;\n  box-shadow:0 10px 22px color-mix(in srgb,#000 20%,transparent);\n  border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 40%,transparent)}\n\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  .board{gap:12px;padding:20px 24px}\n  .col{gap:10px;padding:12px;border-radius:16px}\n  .col-head{gap:8px;padding:0 4px}\n  .col-head b{font-size:14px}\n  .cnt{font-size:11px;padding:2px 7px}\n  .cards{gap:8px}\n  .card{gap:3px;padding:12px 13px;border-radius:11px}\n  .card b{font-size:13px}\n  .card span{font-size:11px}\n}\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .board{gap:4px;padding:8px 9px}\n  .col{gap:3px;padding:4px;border-radius:8px}\n  .col-head{gap:4px}\n  .col-head b{font-size:7.5px}\n  .cnt{font-size:6.5px;padding:1px 3px}\n  .cards{gap:3px}\n  .card{padding:4px 5px;border-radius:5px}\n  .card b{font-size:7.5px}\n  .card span{font-size:6.5px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .col,.card{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"board\" id=\"board\">\n  <div class=\"col\" data-col=\"todo\">\n    <div class=\"col-head\"><b>待办</b><span class=\"cnt\">2</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <div class=\"card\" tabindex=\"0\"><b>配色方案</b><span>林舟</span></div>\n      <div class=\"card\" tabindex=\"0\"><b>组件库</b><span>我</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col\" data-col=\"doing\">\n    <div class=\"col-head\"><b>进行中</b><span class=\"cnt\">2</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <div class=\"card\" tabindex=\"0\"><b>本周迭代</b><span>团队</span></div>\n      <div class=\"card\" tabindex=\"0\"><b>文档站</b><span>我</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col\" data-col=\"done\">\n    <div class=\"col-head\"><b>已完成</b><span class=\"cnt\">1</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <div class=\"card\" tabindex=\"0\"><b>发布检查</b><span>团队</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var board = document.getElementById('board'),\n      cols = [].slice.call(board.querySelectorAll('.col'));\n\n  var drag = null, timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false;\n\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i = 0; i < timers.length; i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers = []; }\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n      setTimeout(function(){ if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 120);\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){ if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show'); }\n\n  function updateCounts(){\n    for(var i = 0; i < cols.length; i++){\n      cols[i].querySelector('.cnt').textContent = cols[i].querySelectorAll('.card').length;\n    }\n  }\n\n  function colAt(x, y){\n    for(var i = 0; i < cols.length; i++){\n      var r = cols[i].getBoundingClientRect();\n      if(x >= r.left && x <= r.right && y >= r.top && y <= r.bottom) return cols[i];\n    }\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  function clearHighlight(){\n    for(var i = 0; i < cols.length; i++) cols[i].classList.remove('drop-target');\n  }\n\n  function finish(card, target){\n    card.classList.remove('dragging');\n    card.style.transition = '';\n    card.style.transform = '';\n    if(target && !target.contains(card)){\n      target.querySelector('.cards').appendChild(card);\n    }\n    clearHighlight();\n    updateCounts();\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 真实 pointer 拖拽 ---------- */\n  function bindCard(card){\n    card.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){\n      if(drag) return;\n      e.preventDefault();\n      drag = { card: card, x0: e.clientX, y0: e.clientY };\n      card.classList.add('dragging');\n      card.style.transition = 'none';\n      try { card.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(_e){}\n    });\n    card.addEventListener('pointermove', function(e){\n      if(!drag || drag.card !== card) return;\n      var dx = e.clientX - drag.x0, dy = e.clientY - drag.y0;\n      card.style.transform = 'translate(' + dx + 'px,' + dy + 'px) rotate(1.5deg) scale(1.03)';\n      var target = colAt(e.clientX, e.clientY);\n      for(var i = 0; i < cols.length; i++){\n        cols[i].classList.toggle('drop-target', cols[i] === target && !cols[i].contains(card));\n      }\n    });\n    card.addEventListener('pointerup', function(e){\n      if(!drag || drag.card !== card) return;\n      var target = colAt(e.clientX, e.clientY);\n      drag = null;\n      finish(card, target);\n    });\n    card.addEventListener('pointercancel', function(){\n      if(!drag || drag.card !== card) return;\n      drag = null;\n      finish(card, null);\n    });\n  }\n  var allCards = [].slice.call(board.querySelectorAll('.card'));\n  for(var i = 0; i < allCards.length; i++) bindCard(allCards[i]);\n\n  /* ---------- 演示：模拟一次拖拽（光标按住卡片 → 落到第二列） ---------- */\n  function simDrag(card, target){\n    var tr = target.getBoundingClientRect(),\n        cr = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n    card.classList.add('dragging');\n    card.style.transition = 'transform .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)';\n    card.style.transform = 'translate(' + (tr.left + 12 - cr.left) + 'px,' + (tr.top + 46 - cr.top) + 'px) rotate(1.5deg) scale(1.03)';\n    target.classList.add('drop-target');\n  }\n\n  function resetBoard(){\n    var todo = cols[0].querySelector('.cards'),\n        doing = cols[1].querySelector('.cards'),\n        done = cols[2].querySelector('.cards');\n    var c0 = allCards[0], c1 = allCards[1], c2 = allCards[2], c3 = allCards[3], c4 = allCards[4];\n    todo.appendChild(c0); todo.appendChild(c1);\n    doing.appendChild(c2); doing.appendChild(c3);\n    done.appendChild(c4);\n    for(var i = 0; i < allCards.length; i++){\n      allCards[i].classList.remove('dragging');\n      allCards[i].style.transform = '';\n      allCards[i].style.transition = '';\n    }\n    clearHighlight();\n    updateCounts();\n  }\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    resetBoard();\n    ensureCursor();\n    if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide();\n\n    var card = allCards[0], target = cols[1];\n    later(function(){\n      if(cursor){ showCursor(); cursor.moveTo(card); }\n      later(function(){\n        if(cursor) cursor.press();\n        simDrag(card, target);\n      }, 500);\n      later(function(){ if(cursor){ cursor.moveTo(target); } }, 900);\n      later(function(){\n        finish(card, target);\n        if(cursor) cursor.release();\n      }, 1650);\n      later(function(){ if(typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 2000);\n    }, 350);\n    later(resetBoard, 3600);\n    later(demoCycle, 4200);\n  }\n\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){\n    /* 弹窗初始态：所有卡片归位，不残留任何拖拽 transform / rotate */\n    for(var i = 0; i < allCards.length; i++){\n      allCards[i].classList.remove('dragging');\n      allCards[i].style.transition = '';\n      allCards[i].style.transform = '';\n    }\n    clearHighlight();\n    updateCounts();\n  } else {\n    setTimeout(demoCycle, 300);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
